[32m+[m[32m# Viewer behavior[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe viewer:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- retrieves the symbol list from the backend;[m
[32m+[m[32m- loads adjusted OHLCV at runtime;[m
[32m+[m[32m- calculates indicators in the browser from the full loaded history;[m
[32m+[m[32m- calculates the current prototype trend-following signals in the frontend;[m
[32m+[m[32m- supports zoom and horizontal pan;[m
[32m+[m[32m- supports presets such as `1M`, `3M`, `6M`, `1Y`, `3Y`, `5Y`, and `ALL`;[m
[32m+[m[32m- remembers the last successfully loaded symbol in browser local storage;[m
[32m+[m[32m- allows signal markers to be clicked to inspect why a signal fired.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe original prototype signal logic is implemented in:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32msrc/App.jsx[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
 [m
[31m-- `GET /health`[m
